         <div type="div1">
            <head>CONTENTS /x/</head>
            <p>
               <hi rend="bold">Transcriber's Note:</hi> This list of titles was created by the transcriber to aid the reader.</p>
            <p>A Song of Six-Pence<lb/>Paying Back<lb/>The Generous Clover<lb/>Where They Grow<lb/>Ba-by Fay Fern-y<lb/>The Dough-Dog<lb/>The Lion’s O-pin-ion of Him-self<lb/>Which Is Tall-est<lb/>The Anx-ious Dog-gy<lb/>Nine Little Birdies<lb/>What Ba-by Did<lb/>Two Kind Lit-tle Girls<lb/>An April Rain<lb/>What the Grasses Said<lb/>Tab-by’s Lull-a-by<lb/>Some Naughty I’s<lb/>At Break-fast<lb/>Ba-by Dim-ple at Break-fast<lb/>Nobody Knows<lb/>The Lost Chickens<lb/>Like Baby<lb/>How the Baby Was Named<lb/>The Window-Pane Tree<lb/>Birds in Winter<lb/>Three Travellers<lb/>A Tale of a Bot-tle<lb/>A Wonderful Scholar<lb/>Out in the Meadow<lb/>
            </p>
